The Eskiz look (Actions > Settings) also embeds **Atkinson Hyperlegible Next** 2.001 (Regular and
SemiBold), unmodified: Copyright 2020-2024 The Atkinson Hyperlegible Next Project Authors
(<https://github.com/googlefonts/atkinson-hyperlegible-next>), licensed under the SIL Open Font
