## Unicode-3.0 data

The ICU4X crates (`icu_*`, `litemap`, `potential_utf`, `tinystr`, `writeable`, `yoke`, `zerofrom`,
`zerotrie`, `zerovec`) and `unicode-ident` include data under the Unicode License v3 (Unicode-3.0). Its
copyright and permission notice is reproduced below under "Unicode License v3".

## OpenH264

The default and distributed builds do not link OpenH264: MP4 export is off in 0.1.0, and
no H.264 code is included. A developer build with `--features mp4` compiles Cisco's OpenH264
(BSD-2-Clause) and must reproduce Cisco's notice and the H.264 patent licensing that applies to that
binary.

